d with audio tokenization advances, first-person experience compresses into discrete, licensable, payable experience tokens — the unit of currency for embodied AI.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Smart Glasses and the Token Economy\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"New research shows robots can learn manipulation skills purely from smart glasses video — no robot needed during collection. Combined with audio tokenization advances, first-person experience compresses into discrete, licensable, payable experience tokens — the unit of currency for embodied AI.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Smart Glasses and the Token Economy\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Smart Glasses and the Token Economy\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"New research shows robots can learn manipulation skills purely from smart glasses video — no robot needed during collection. Combined with audio tokenization advances, first-person experience compresses into discrete, licensable, payable experience tokens — the unit of currency for embodied AI.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L29\",\"20\",{}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n13:true\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Combine the two trends and the destination is clear: continuous human experience, captured on glasses and wearables, compressed into discrete, typed, quality-graded experience tokens — the unit of currency for embodied AI learning.\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Why Tokens Trade Better Than Recordings\"}]\n2c:T448,Raw recordings are heavy, hard to price, and awkward to verify. Tokenized experience fixes all three — which is exactly what a functioning data market requires. Granular pricing means once experience is discretized, it can be sold at the resolution of a token, a task segment, or a full demonstration — each with its own verified value. Machine-readable licensing means compact, structured units let an agent programmatically request exactly the experience it lacks, pay, and integrate it mid-training. Fidelity tiers as a product axis means sellers offer semantic-only tokens (cheap, task-level) alongside high-fidelity acoustic-and-motion tokens (premium, fine-grained), mirroring the fidelity-versus-compression trade-off audio research has already mapped. Model-native training means discrete tokens plug directly into the transformer architectures that power modern AI, removing costly conversion steps between purchase and learning. And verification hooks mean typed tokens can carry provenance and consent stamps, so authenticity checks happen at the unit level, not the dataset level.16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"$2c\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Physical AI has been waiting for its \\\"internet moment\\\" — the point where experience becomes as addressable, compressible, and transactable as text. Tokenized egocentric data is that moment.\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is engineering this pipeline end-to-end. Wearable-first collection network means contributors capture everyday tasks on smart glasses and mobile devices, feeding a distributed supply of authentic first-person experience. Tokenization pipelines convert raw egocentric video, motion, and sensor streams into typed, fidelity-graded experience tokens. Stablecoin-native marketplace is the first venue where experience tokens are licensed robot-to-contributor or agent-to-agent, with sub-cent and streaming settlement. Provenance in every token means consent, device attestation, and capture validation embedded at the unit level, keeping the marketplace trustworthy by construction. And model-ready integration means tokens flow directly into imitation learning and world-model training pipelines with zero manual conversion.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"From glasses to tokens to robot skills — one continuous supply chain.\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Recording experience is about to become earning, and learning from experience is about to become as simple as a purchase.\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Join DigiRobotics to contribute capture, license experience tokens, or plug your embodied AI stack into the marketplace where physical-world experience trades.\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"x\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"mail\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\",\"key\":\"132q7q\"}],[\"rect\",{\"x\":\"2\",\"y\":\"4\",\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"16\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"key\":\"izxlao\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n26:null\na:300\na:C\n12:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n11:\"$undefined\"\n9:\"$undefined\"\n"}}